  "quotes": [
    {
      "block": "原句1",
      "no": 1,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "It was just as easy for her mind to spin this nightmare",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1721
        }
      ],
      "words": 12
    },
    {
      "block": "原句2",
      "no": 2,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“Please let him know that the paperwork has been filed and approved by the board. His grant is fully funded.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 3693
        }
      ],
      "words": 20
    },
    {
      "block": "原句3",
      "no": 3,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“And did you complain to Dr. Taliesin about the error? I understand your project was defunded, and that’s very disappoin",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 4190
        }
      ],
      "words": 20
    },
    {
      "block": "原句4",
      "no": 4,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“You weren’t my first choice,” he said. “But I didn’t make the office assignments. Dr. Taliesin did. I tried to get him ",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 6726
        }
      ],
      "words": 27
    },
    {
      "block": "原句5",
      "no": 5,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Evan has already let me know that you were struggling. That he has been helping you stay afloat for a year now",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 8517
        }
      ],
      "words": 22
    },
    {
      "block": "原句6",
      "no": 6,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“I don’t tell my family every time I end up fucking a friend.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 11057
        }
      ],
      "words": 13
    },
    {
      "block": "原句7",
      "no": 7,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“There has been an expiration date on this from the moment you kissed me in that tent.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 12989
        }
      ],
      "words": 17
    },
    {
      "block": "原句8",
      "no": 8,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "She had the horrible thought that maybe Evan wasn’t the problem at all. Maybe it was her",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 13700
        }
      ],
      "words": 17
    },
    {
      "block": "原句9",
      "no": 9,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“This has to end. Now,” she went on. “Before we hurt each other more. Before our lives are too intertwined.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 14135
        }
      ],
      "words": 20
    },
    {
      "block": "原句10",
      "no": 10,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“Can I kiss you goodbye at least? One last time?”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 15456
        }
      ],
      "words": 10
    },
    {
      "block": "原句11",
      "no": 11,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "His face collapsed, but he turned and left the office, closing the door behind him",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 16193
        }
      ],
      "words": 15
    }
